Sometimes I feel more comfortable like this.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:44.120
Sometimes I feel more comfortable like this.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:49.120
Sometimes my hand will fall asleep, so I go halfway between.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.120
If it's cold,

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:56.120
I will do left hand, right hand.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.120
Then your arms are touching your body.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:04.120
