00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.120
I have a friend in the monastery.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.120
He always meditates laying down.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:53.120
And everyone said he's crazy.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:03:01.120
Then one night we had a debate competition

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:04.120
with the other monastery.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:09.120
And he was sitting down for our side.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.120
We called Dam Cha Shak.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.120
He was the defender.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.120
And he was representing our monastery.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:27.120
And he started to do what Hasso did.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:33.120
To the other monastery's debater.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:36.120
The other monastery was Tashi Humbo.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:41.120
This is the Panchen Lama's monastery.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:46.120
And he really destroyed the other side.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:54.120
And we were all shocked because he always meditated laying down.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:04:00.120
And when he studies he always has rock and roll music in his ears,

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.120
illegally, in the monastery.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:08.120
And he beat all those guys.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:12.120
Then the abbot got upset.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.120
Tashi Hlunpo abbot.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:22.120
And he's the greatest tantric master, maybe in South India.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:27.120
He's Geshe Thubten Rinchen's teacher.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:31.120
Then he came up, attacked our guy.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:36.120
It's like the football coach running to the football.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.120
He came and attacked him.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:42.120
It's like when the football coach goes and starts playing.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:47.120
And he beat him.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:55.120
Then the old abbot, he took off his hat.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:05:02.120
So it's a proof you can meditate laying down.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.120
It doesn't really matter.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.120
What matters is you have seed for good meditation.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:20.120
The seed for good meditation is one week before you plan to meditate,

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:29.120
be very considerate of other people's feelings.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:37.120
Like never say anything which upsets other people's feelings.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:48.120
Be very careful what you say to other people.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:53.120
Then you are making their mind peaceful.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:06:00.120
Then every time you do that, you are planting seeds to have a peaceful meditation.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:06.120
